/	17-APR-77	S.R.	DEV: DVCODE
/	17-APR-77	S.R.	FINISHED TTY SCOPE
/	27-APR-77	S.R.	TTY COL
/	27-APR-77	S.R.	SYS OPTIONS (INIT, OS8, OS78)
