	CIA
	DCA TEMP
	JMS I [ALPHA		/IS IT ALPHANUMERIC?
	JMP EOK			/NO
	TAD TEMP		/COMPARE
	CLL RAL			/LOW ORDER 11 BITS
	SNA CLA
	JMP KL			/MATCHED, KEEP LOOKING
	JMP I KEYSRCH		/DIDN'T MATCH
EOK,	JMS I [BACKC
	TAD TEMP
	CIA			/INPUT STREAM RAN OUT OR HIT SPACE
	SPA CLA
	JMP GOTKEY		/SPACE OR EOL MATCH FLAGGED CHARACTER
	JMP I KEYSRCH

